<td>7 years</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Photo ID</td>
<td>3 years</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Assessments</td>
<td>5 years</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><strong>The platform retains documents according to these schedules.</strong> Don\'t manually delete documents — the system handles retention automatically.</p>
